1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 116, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118396513541857743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus Cheaper videos, same expensive addiction to compute", "url": "https://x.com/DrAi404/status/2118413971719893169"}, {"author_id": "889472197764493312", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:38:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118412635972775970"], "id": "2118412635972775970", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118396513541857743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus At $1.05 a clip, anyone wrapping this in a flat monthly plan needs a cap on seconds per user, or a few heavy users eat the whole margin.", "url": "https://x.com/vincenzo_naked/status/2118412635972775970"}, {"author_id": "1471034497500172290", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:36:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118412219209916795"], "id": "2118412219209916795", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118396513541857743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus 15 seconds and 30% cheaper.\n\ncurious if conversational edits burn the same rate as a fresh generate", "url": "https://x.com/AgentikHQ/status/2118412219209916795"}, {"author_id": "1032195487", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:27:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118409925097640015"], "id": "2118409925097640015", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118396513541857743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus do you think this will be a tough competitor for OpenAI’s new image generation model ?", "url": "https://x.com/knowixbuilds/status/2118409925097640015"}, {"author_id": "2106079229419069440", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:21:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118408480029639078"], "id": "2118408480029639078", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118396513541857743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus 15 seconds for just over a dollar? not bad at all", "url": "https://x.com/NeuroFoxxx/status/2118408480029639078"}, {"author_id": "1538661635921006592", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:18:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118407705152872786"], "id": "2118407705152872786", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118396513541857743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus Google is really keeping us busy with all these releases haha, I can barely keep up with testing everything", "url": "https://x.com/azed_ai/status/2118407705152872786"}, {"author_id": "1721496460053635072", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:17:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118407315934298296"], "id": "2118407315934298296", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118396513541857743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus 15 seconds of video. 30% cheaper than the last version.\nGoogle's launch strategy: undercut yourself first.", "url": "https://x.com/buildsinews/status/2118407315934298296"}, {"author_id": "2389244888", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:16:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118406997016203426"], "id": "2118406997016203426", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118396513541857743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus $0.07/s for 15s of video is a real inflection for on-the-fly sim generation, makes iterative policy eval loops actually practical", "url": "https://x.com/sarathms97/status/2118406997016203426"}, {"author_id": "2116404268328706048", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:15:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118406845274665165"], "id": "2118406845274665165", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118396513541857743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus google shipping two big things in one day is greedy in the best way", "url": "https://x.com/GodanLeeX/status/2118406845274665165"}, {"author_id": "2063603235089428480", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:07:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118404769945640962"], "id": "2118404769945640962", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118396513541857743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus $0.07 a second is $4.20 a minute at 720p. Fine for a test, but a 10 minute kids cartoon is $42 per render, and you rarely get it right in one try.", "url": "https://x.com/Aibrat0/status/2118404769945640962"}, {"author_id": "867599678631751681", "created_at": "2026-11-05T18:06:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118404534787866877"], "id": "2118404534787866877", "